usage: plan.py add-item [-h] [--plans-root PLANS_ROOT] --title TITLE
                        [--batch BATCH] [--json JSON | --file FILE]
                        plan phase

add a skeleton item to a phase

positional arguments:
  plan                  plan id, PLAN<N> or path
  phase

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --plans-root PLANS_ROOT
                        plans/ directory (default: nearest up from cwd)
  --title TITLE
  --batch BATCH         join (or create) this batch; default a solo batch
  --json JSON           JSON text, or @file
  --file FILE           file holding the JSON
